Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Stained Glass OS -- Microsoft Office (which users install themselves).
;
; Office draws its windows (the ribbon, the page, dialogs) into Direct3D 11
; textures shared between devices and guarded by keyed mutexes. The Vulkan
; translation layer cannot share textures that way under Wine yet
; (VK_KHR_external_memory_win32, KeyedMutex::AcquireSync unsupported), so
; every Office window stayed empty but for its lines. With hardware
; acceleration off Office draws in software, which works: Word's ribbon and
; page appear (QA VM, 2026-09-29). Office's own setting (File > Options >
; Advanced > Display) turns it back on for anyone who wants to try.
; HKCU values here reach every new user through the Default User profile.
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Microsoft\Office\16.0\Common\Graphics]
"DisableHardwareAcceleration"=dword:00000001
